TI  - Energy and Water Management in Smart Buildings Using Spiking Neural Networks: A Low-Power, Event-Driven Approach for Adaptive Control and Anomaly Detection
T2  - ENERGIES
LA  - English
KW  - spiking neural networks
KW  - smart building automation
KW  - event-driven processing
KW  - energy efficiency on edge computing
