TI  - AI and BIM integration and PERGE adoption framework: mapping the network of AI methods and emerging impacts using CEGM
T2  - SMART AND SUSTAINABLE BUILT ENVIRONMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Artificial intelligence (AI)
KW  - Machine learning
KW  - Large language models
