TI  - Machine Learning-Based Short-Circuit Prediction in Electricity Distribution Transformers
T2  - JOURNAL OF ELECTRICAL AND COMPUTER ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - distribution transformers
KW  - fault prediction
KW  - machine learning
KW  - random forest
