TI  - Predict the priority of end-users' maintenance requests and the required technical staff through LSTM and Bi-LSTM recurrent neural networks
T2  - FACILITIES
LA  - English
KW  - Building maintenance
KW  - Facilities management
KW  - Machine learning
KW  - NLP
KW  - Text mining
