AB  - Aiming at the problem that the durability multi-parameters of the industrial building can not be completely and accurately measured, which leads to the deviation of the effects of structure durability evaluation, the method for evaluating the durability of industrial building is proposed. Firstly, the knowledge-based rough set containing key parameters such as environment temperature, humidity and depth of carbonation are established. Then, attribute reduction is operated and the decision tree of durability evaluation of typical components in the industrial building is achieved by using the reduced key set of attributes. Finally, get the whole structure durability evaluation results. The example proved that the methodology reduces the complexity of evaluating decision tree construction and improves the real-time performance and accuracy of structure durability evaluation. It is scientific principle to the industrial building maintenance and operation with scientific guidance.
