TI  - Generative AI in facility management: a structural topic modeling (STM) review with qualitative synthesis
T2  - JOURNAL OF FACILITIES MANAGEMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Natural language processing
KW  - Facility management
KW  - Predictive maintenance
KW  - Explainable artificial intelligence
