TI  - Ontology-enabled AI agent-driven intelligent digital twins for building operations and maintenance
T2  - JOURNAL OF BUILDING ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - Digital twin (DT)
KW  - Intelligent digital twin (IDT)
KW  - Built environments
KW  - AI agent
KW  - Large language model (LLM)
KW  - Ontology
