TI  - Physics-informed anomaly and fault detection for wind energy systems using deep CNN and adaptive elite PSO-XGBoost
T2  - IET GENERATION TRANSMISSION & DISTRIBUTION
LA  - English
KW  - artificial intelligence
KW  - convolutional neural nets
KW  - gradient methods
KW  - particle swarm optimisation
