TI  - An Effective Predictive Maintenance Framework for Conveyor Motors Using Dual Time-Series Imaging and Convolutional Neural Network in an Industry 4.0 Environment
T2  - IEEE ACCESS
LA  - English
KW  - Convolutional neural network (CNN)
