TI  - An Integrated Experimental and Machine Learning Approach for Machinability Assessment and Tool Life Prediction in Drilling of 14NiCr10 Alloy Using AlTiN-Coated Carbide Tools
T2  - ENGINEERING REPORTS
LA  - English
KW  - 14NiCr10
