TI  - Comparative study of the 1DCNN, WT-2DCNN, LSTM, and 1DCNN-LSTM models to predict machinery faults based on vibrations measured from a simulation facility for petrochemical processes
T2  - JOURNAL OF INCLUSION PHENOMENA AND MACROCYCLIC CHEMISTRY
LA  - English
KW  - 1DCNN
