TI  - Intelligent Fault Warning Method for Wind Turbine Gear Transmission System Driven by Digital Twin and Multi-Source Data Fusion
T2  - APPLIED SCIENCES-BASEL
LA  - English
KW  - digital twin
KW  - multi-source data fusion
KW  - wind turbine gear transmission system
