TI  - NeuroFusionNet Adaptive Deep Learning for Intelligent Real-Time Industrial IoT Decisions
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF ADVANCED COMPUTER SCIENCE AND APPLICATIONS
LA  - English
KW  - Deep learning
KW  - hybrid CNN-BiGRU
KW  - OptiSenseNet
