TI  - Evaluating learning strategies for fault diagnosis in HVAC systems under labeled data scarcity: toward a metamodel-based transfer learning approach
T2  - ENERGY AND BUILDINGS
LA  - English
KW  - Fault detection and diagnosis
KW  - Metamodel-based transfer learning
KW  - Supervised-learning
KW  - Unsupervised learning
