TI  - Data-driven monitoring of powder build-up for condition-based maintenance in semiconductor manufacturing facility
T2  - JOURNAL OF QUALITY IN MAINTENANCE ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - Condition monitoring
KW  - Diagnosis
KW  - Fault detection
KW  - Industrial maintenance
