TI  - A novel dynamic predictive maintenance framework for gearboxes utilizing nonlinear Wiener process
T2  - MEASUREMENT SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - full-life degradation experiments
KW  - Wiener process
KW  - remaining useful life prediction
