TI  - A Graph-Embedded Subdomain Adaptation Approach for Remaining Useful Life Prediction of Industrial IoT Systems
T2  - IEEE INTERNET OF THINGS JOURNAL
LA  - English
KW  - Graph embedding
KW  - Industrial Internet of Things (IIoT)
KW  - manifold learning
KW  - remaining useful life (RUL)
KW  - rolling bearing
KW  - subdomain adaptation (SA)
KW  - FAULT-DIAGNOSIS
