TI  - Fault Diagnosis Scheme Based on the Stockwell Transform for a Multilevel Converter of a Switched Reluctance Motor Drive
T2  - 2024 13TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON RENEWABLE ENERGY RESEARCH AND APPLICATIONS, ICRERA 2024
LA  - English
CP  - 13th International Conference on Renewable Energy Research and Applications
