TI  - An Equipment Behavioral Study in Fluidic Production Processes using Data for an Optimized Predictive Maintenance: Application to Pneumatic Valves in Biopharmaceutical Industry
T2  - FME TRANSACTIONS
LA  - English
KW  - Predictive Maintenance
KW  - Mechanical Engineering
KW  - Fluidic Systems
