TI  - A preprocessed and labeled image dataset of building facades for UAV-Based maintenance applications
T2  - IFAC PAPERSONLINE
LA  - English
CP  - 7th IFAC Symposium on Telematics Applications TA
KW  - UAV applications
KW  - Remote inspection
