TI  - Screening for Anomalous Safety Condition Among Existing Buildings Using Explainable Machine Learning
T2  - STRUCTURAL CONTROL & HEALTH MONITORING
LA  - English
KW  - building structural safety
KW  - existing building
KW  - explainable machine learning
