TI  - Intelligent Fault Diagnosis for Elevators Using Temporal Adaptive Fault Network
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF ADVANCED COMPUTER SCIENCE AND APPLICATIONS
LA  - English
KW  - Elevator fault diagnosis
KW  - temporal adaptive fault network
KW  - predictive maintenance
