TI  - Study on remaining useful life prediction of sliding bearings in nuclear power plant shielded pumps based on nearest similar distance particle filtering
T2  - ANNALS OF NUCLEAR ENERGY
LA  - English
KW  - Sliding Bearing
KW  - Full Life Cycle Experiment
KW  - Improved Particle Filter
KW  - Remaining Useful Life Prediction
KW  - Predictive maintenance
KW  - WEAR COEFFICIENT
KW  - DATA-DRIVEN
AB  - Shielded pumps are widely used in reactors such as China's "Guohe-1 '' and the U.S. AP1000, playing a crucial role in efficiently transferring reactor heat to steam generators. The thrust bearing is a key rotating component in nuclear power system pumps, supporting axial loads generated during operation and limiting rotor movement, which is critical to the safe operation of the entire pump. To address the deficiencies in thrust-bearing failure mechanism research and the scarcity of equipment failure data, this paper proposes techniques for predicting remaining useful life (RUL) based on predictive maintenance principles. Considering the operating environment of plain bearings subjected to frequent variable conditions and continuous loading, this study investigates the RUL prediction technology based on an improved particle filter method. This approach could effectively mitigate particle depletion problems common to traditional filtering methods, thereby improving the accuracy of RUL prediction. In this research, experimental simulations are performed to analyze the wear degradation process of bearings, state equation and measurement equation are constructed for the prediction model. Optimization of the resampling process is achieved using the nearest similarity distance metric, which allows filtered tracking of device measurements. Finally, by verifying and optimizing the model hyperparameters with full life cycle data, the RUL prediction model suitable for the plain bearing wear process is developed. This model offers new perspectives and methods for ensuring both the safety and economic viability of nuclear power plants or other sophisticated industrial facilities.
