TI  - As-built BIM reconstruction of piping systems using PipeNet
T2  - AUTOMATION IN CONSTRUCTION
LA  - English
KW  - Building information modeling
KW  - As-built BIM
KW  - Scan-to-BIM
KW  - 3D reconstruction
KW  - Deep learning
