TI  - HYPER-PARAMETER OPTIMIZATION OF DEEP LEARNING MODELS FOR COMPRESSOR AIR LEAK PREDICTION IN A GAS TURBINE
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE ASME 2022 POWER CONFERENCE, POWER2022
